  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: Boss
    text: Hello, this is your first night, pretty sure you can't wait to work, but
      listen, i still have problem with the shipment, but i still want you to go
      to work untill dawn, okay?
  - speakerName: You
    text: Um.... what should i do if this mart dont have the goods, sir?
  - speakerName: Boss
    text: Just keep an eye on the mart until dawn, i'll call again if something happen,
      okay?
  - speakerName: You
    text: Yes sir
